{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/93e1fd15fa3696474dad820ac11c17a8.apng?t=1772594954\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/93e1fd15fa3696474dad820ac11c17a8.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=108 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sir Solomon and the saviors of light depart Castle Cornelius to free Princess Tsuna from the grasp of the evil Devil Lord!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But the knight is worried... what if after being freed, the princess falls in love with one of his friends instead of with him?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So he does what anyone would do when blinded by love, and ditches his friends! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Solomon ventures into the Devil Lord's castle alone, vowing to make the princess his.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" width=618 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.webm?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.mp4?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LABS</strong> and <strong>Matt Kap</strong> present <strong>Lovish</strong>, an outrageous 8-bit-styled action-adventure game! Venture through a series of bite-sized rooms, slicing up monsters, collecting items and getting to the exit! After exiting each room, enjoy a short <strong>event scene</strong>, in which <strong>anything could happen</strong>! Will you find an item? A random encounter RPG fight? Will the world get destroyed? Find out by conquering each room of the Devil Lord's castle, one challenge at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/996d765de819f4a6148e1aa9aaefbee3.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" width=618 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/996d765de819f4a6148e1aa9aaefbee3.webm?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/99d3c4514491a550afe3cbdb5323ef73.apng?t=1772594954\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/99d3c4514491a550afe3cbdb5323ef73.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=378 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>50+</strong> fun levels to play through, each with multiple objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky randomized event scenes between levels with <strong>hundreds</strong> of outcomes! You never know what you're gonna see next!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect a variety of items to upgrade Solomon's abilities, or expand the game in meaningful (and unmeaningful) ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spend your pennies (in-game currency to be clear, no microtransactions here) in the in-game shop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>100+</strong> characters, some of which were designed by world-famous manga artist Ryusuke Mita (Dragon Half)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An exciting, <strong>20+</strong> tune soundtrack by Matt Kap (Castle In The Darkness, Astalon: Tears of the Earth)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful human-artist-made pixel art! Even the in-game AI art is drawn by a human person!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More secrets than ever before! (But this is the first game in this series, so that doesn't mean much, I guess.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unexpected guest characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And lots more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So please, be a good friend, and help Solomon rescue the princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"R.I.P. Solomon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/04f2457a898674f41dd0ae0b8d1b98339e7c1188.jpg"},{"name":"Life savings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/645c3223aa147185e4fc2724439770e3b9f86b0d.jpg"},{"name":"Maybe it's fungirl?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/de8dd7fd0c2f2bab6b745f3b610b7964a93af6cf.jpg"},{"name":"You dirty rat!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/edc7996704430ca51ae20aa7019effaabfc3d8b9.jpg"},{"name":"It's a bird! It's a plane! No... it's a bird.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/ce47a28f1ae2420f541de2a93dce73ac6a3af612.jpg"},{"name":"Are you copying me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/b9243cd879a50f883d9be1886274778790ec977e.jpg"},{"name":"Soft and wet?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/ef3efb59b8ccb2382e391d955467bf91e895e608.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the rightful owner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/d7f961639463bb1de8589ff1622da497caceda1c.jpg"},{"name":"Infested!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/6b0bf4a7708c116f0120c1411934fa29650d37fb.jpg"},{"name":"I hate you, Devil Lord!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2959010/66ac381219464fb9f4b091ed2825597c12707ba4.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2959010?t=1772594954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772594954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772594954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772594954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3263960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/93e1fd15fa3696474dad820ac11c17a8.apng?t=1772594954\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/93e1fd15fa3696474dad820ac11c17a8.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=108 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sir Solomon and the saviors of light depart Castle Cornelius to free Princess Tsuna from the grasp of the evil Devil Lord!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But the knight is worried... what if after being freed, the princess falls in love with one of his friends instead of with him?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So he does what anyone would do when blinded by love, and ditches his friends! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Solomon ventures into the Devil Lord's castle alone, vowing to make the princess his.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" width=618 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.webm?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/b9900326e81c0df44a181003371ca771.mp4?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LABS</strong> and <strong>Matt Kap</strong> present <strong>Lovish</strong>, an outrageous 8-bit-styled action-adventure game! Venture through a series of bite-sized rooms, slicing up monsters, collecting items and getting to the exit! After exiting each room, enjoy a short <strong>event scene</strong>, in which <strong>anything could happen</strong>! Will you find an item? A random encounter RPG fight? Will the world get destroyed? Find out by conquering each room of the Devil Lord's castle, one challenge at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/996d765de819f4a6148e1aa9aaefbee3.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" width=618 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/996d765de819f4a6148e1aa9aaefbee3.webm?t=1772594954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/99d3c4514491a550afe3cbdb5323ef73.apng?t=1772594954\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/extras/99d3c4514491a550afe3cbdb5323ef73.poster.avif?t=1772594954\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=378 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>50+</strong> fun levels to play through, each with multiple objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky randomized event scenes between levels with <strong>hundreds</strong> of outcomes! You never know what you're gonna see next!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect a variety of items to upgrade Solomon's abilities, or expand the game in meaningful (and unmeaningful) ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spend your pennies (in-game currency to be clear, no microtransactions here) in the in-game shop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>100+</strong> characters, some of which were designed by world-famous manga artist Ryusuke Mita (Dragon Half)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An exciting, <strong>20+</strong> tune soundtrack by Matt Kap (Castle In The Darkness, Astalon: Tears of the Earth)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful human-artist-made pixel art! Even the in-game AI art is drawn by a human person!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More secrets than ever before! (But this is the first game in this series, so that doesn't mean much, I guess.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unexpected guest characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And lots more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So please, be a good friend, and help Solomon rescue the princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LABS Works"],"dlc":[3830540],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/header.jpg?t=1772594954","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2026, LABS Works.<br />\r\nDANGEN ENTERTAINMENT is a trademark of Dangen Entertainment. <br />\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Dangen Entertainment. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/1732747565/35b9a2ae4d292460c3ed11968763f64a5fac30c8/1768498049/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769925636","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/1732747565/35b9a2ae4d292460c3ed11968763f64a5fac30c8/1768498049/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769925636","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/1732747565/35b9a2ae4d292460c3ed11968763f64a5fac30c8/1768498049/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769925636","id":257265412,"name":"Lovish - Release Date Trailer (EN)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257265412/9096b816d9407c9e0b6f67eaf0bb739963b9c5ff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769925636"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/788991/607a64874413a2d20e1be01f84d7fa7435d0da4d/1750953278/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768501905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/788991/607a64874413a2d20e1be01f84d7fa7435d0da4d/1750953278/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768501905","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2959010/788991/607a64874413a2d20e1be01f84d7fa7435d0da4d/1750953278/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768501905","id":257075388,"name":"The MIX Fall Showcase 2024 (EN)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075388/97dd2dfe383021f6a5b18769a1d19618fb41f2b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768501905"}],"name":"Lovish","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Lovish - $14.99 USD","packageid":1053480,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}],"title":"Buy Lovish"}],"packages":[1053480],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP SP3 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4 2.00GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 6100 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron G1101 @ 2.27GHz or AMD A4-5300B APU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RADEON A9800XT, AMD Radeon R9 A375, or NVIDIA GeForce 940A<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1499,"final_formatted":"$14.99 USD","initial":1499,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["DANGEN Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nNudez\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Sexuelle Andeutungen","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"5 Feb, 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cWhen all is said and done, Lovish is a spectacular game. It\u2019s colorful, creative, funny and easy to play in short bursts. Not only is this one of the best games I\u2019ve played from DANGEN Entertainment and LABS Works, but it\u2019s just engaging and very easy to recommend. Any fan of retro or platformers absolutely needs to own this crazy love letter to the genre.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Hey Poor Player<br><br>\u201cLovish is a chaotic homage to 8-bit action platformers, blending tight single-screen challenges with tongue-in-cheek storytelling and a surprising amount of depth. Players control Sir Solomon, a lovestruck knight tackling absurd scenarios and brutal stages, all while chasing a princess who may not be worth the trouble. With its irreverent tone, punishing one-hit deaths, and rewarding progression system, Lovish balances skill, humor, and nostalgia to deliver a distinctly indie experience that\u2019s both challenging and memorable.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cLovish has a mission statement and it achieves it with flair and confidence. LABS Works has crafted a timeless piece of enjoyment, and I hope it gets as much acclaim as the laughs it gave to me. Don\u2019t hesitate: get in there, and you, too, can experience the bananas adventures of Sir Solomon and his quest of Lovish.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Way Too Many Games<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/f676a439f94bd7bf1af99c09ed55d4bebd3426d8/ss_f676a439f94bd7bf1af99c09ed55d4bebd3426d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772594954","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/f676a439f94bd7bf1af99c09ed55d4bebd3426d8/ss_f676a439f94bd7bf1af99c09ed55d4bebd3426d8.600x338.jpg?t=1772594954"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959010/87fddcafcbad09d100c5da53ec20cf0d4c2a1e9d/ss_87fddcafcbad